U4: Yes
U5: Total toss =TFC + TVC =487/49 =","**यह जो तुम कर रहे हो \(487/49\), वो *Average Total Cost (ATC)* निकालने का तरीका है, “Total Cost” नहीं।** Total Cost तो बस: \[ TC = TFC + TVC = 180 + 307 = \mathbf{487} \] अब Average Total Cost: \[ ATC = \frac{TC}{Q} = \frac{487}{49} \approx 9.94 \] **तो \(\mathbf{487/49 \approx 9.94}\) (₹ per unit)",Procedural,,,,,Academic,,,,1845,64,0.000840,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,gate_llm,gate_llm
