01360da1-446b-4b2a-81a2-de56900b7453,2026-08-16T09:16:17.407Z,31103266,4,"U1: a. An empty basket weighs \( 1 \frac{4}{5} \mathrm{~kg} \). Ravi puts \( 2 \frac{1}{3} \mathrm{~kg} \) of apples in the basket. Find the total weight of the basket and apples together.
