U2: → (j) \( \frac{a}{x+\sqrt{1+x^{2}}} \) का \( x \) के सापेक्ष अवकलन A handwritten Hindi mathematics question asking for the derivative with respect to x of a divided expression involving a constant a and the square root of 1+x².
U3: \( \frac{a}{x+\sqrt{1+x^{2}}} \) का \( x \) के सापेक्ष अवकलन
U4: \( \left(x^{n}+a\right)\left(x^{m}+b\right) \) का \( x \) के सापेक्ष अवकलन","\[ y=\left(x^{n}+a\right)\left(x^{m}+b\right) \] यहाँ \(a,b\) नियतांक हैं (constants) और \(m,n\) भी नियत घात (powers) हैं। Product rule लगाएँ: \[ \frac{dy}{dx}=(x^{n}+a)\frac{d}{dx}(x^{m}+b)+(x^{m}+b)\frac{d}{dx}(x^{n}+a) \] अब, \[ \frac{d}{dx}(x^{m}+b)=mx^{m-1},\qquad \frac{d}{dx}(x^{n}+a)=nx^{n-1}",Procedural,,,,,Academic,,,,1956,64,0.000885,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,gate_llm,gate_llm
