U4: But we don't have physics biology or chemistry in 8th","In many schools, **Class 8 has “Science” as one subject**, but it’s still made of **three parts**: - **Physics** = topics like force, pressure, sound, light, electricity - **Chemistry** = materials, metals/non-metals, changes, acids/bases - **Biology** = plants/animals, cells, microbes, health, repr",Small Talk,,,,,Academic,,,,1758,62,0.000802,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Other Academic,gate_llm,gate_llm
