4207f357-28b1-408a-a9c0-37073aa6f5f0,2026-08-16T02:50:30.433Z,1,3,"U1: Answer A textbook image showing five geometry questions about the angle sums and interior angles of polygons, including finding the number of sides and the measure of each angle.
