तुम्हारी बात समझ आ गई। तुम्हारा **paper 8:00 से 9:00** तक है, और तुम्हें English समझने/बोलने में दिक्कत होती है। 

### ✅ तुम्हारे दिए हुए English sentences की सही form
- **Our paper is from 8:00 to 9:00.** 
- **My name is Mehwish.** *(Mehwish लिखो, spelling अलग‑अलग letters में लिखने की जरूरत नहीं)* 
- **My school’s name is Vedalvi English Medium School.** 
- **My father’s name is Mansoor.** 
- **I am 9 years old.** 
- **I study in Class 5.**

### ❌ मुख्य गलतियाँ (सिर्फ correction)
- **my** → **My** (sentence की शुरुआत में capital) 
- **father name** → **father’s name** (’s लगाना) 
- **i** → **I** (I हमेशा capital) 
- **Mehwish .** ❌ → **Mehwish.** ✅ (dot से पहले space नहीं)

### आज रात 30–40 मिनट की आसान तैयारी
- ऊपर वाले 6 sentences **3 बार बोलो + 3 बार लिखो** 
- ये 10 छोटे words याद करो: **paper, time, start, end, read, write, question, answer, please, help**",Small Talk,1,1,1,2,Academic | Not Math/Science | Speech to Text | Slotfill,,Unwanted Template Push | Correction Ignored,0.9500,23250,487,0.005327,"The session is academic focused on English language learning with speech-to-text and slotfill usage. The bot repeatedly used out-of-scope TEST_PREP templates despite the user's intent for direct help, and the user re-asked multiple times indicating the bot ignored corrections. These failures significantly impacted goal resolution and user sentiment.",0,full_rate,Academic,Language Learning / Translation,explicit_frustration | same_intent_reask | paraphrase_reask | multiple_similar_requests | gate_llm,gate_llm
