U10: Find karna hai 1 upon 5 for 24 and 46 isko find karna hai aur answer a Raha Hai 23 to kaisa hai pura solution ke sath","**\(\frac{1}{5}\) of किसी भी संख्या का मतलब होता है उस संख्या को \(5\) से भाग देना।**

### 1) \(\frac{1}{5}\) of \(24\)
\[
\frac{1}{5}\times 24=\frac{24}{5}
\]
\(24 \div 5\): \(5 \times 4 = 20\), शेष \(24-20=4\)

\[
\frac{24}{5}=4\frac{4}{5}=4.8
\]

**अंतिम उत्तर: \(\mathbf{4\frac{4}{5}}\) (या \(\mathbf{4.8}\))**

---

### 2) \(\frac{1}{5}\) of \(46\)
\[
\frac{1}{5}\times 46=\frac{46}{5}
\]
\(46 \div 5\): \(5 \times 9 = 45\), शेष \(46-45=1\)

\[
\frac{46}{5}=9\frac{1}{5}=9.2
\]

**अंतिम उत्तर: \(\mathbf{9\frac{1}{5}}\) (या \(\mathbf{9.2}\))**

---

### “23” कैसे आ सकता है?
अगर आपने **\(46\)** का \(\frac{1}{5}\) निकालते समय गलती से **\(\frac{1}{2}\)** (half) ले लिया हो, तो:
\[
\frac{1}{2}\text{ of }46 = 23
\]
इसलिए **23 = 46 का half**, **46 का one-fifth नहीं**।

अगर आपका सवाल “\(\frac{1}{5}\) of \(24\) और \(46\)” ही है, तो सही उत्तर ऊपर वाले ही हैं।",NA,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,15018,251,0.003678,"The bot correctly and clearly answers all user queries with accurate math explanations, including clarifications about mixed fractions and fractions of numbers. There are no bot failures or misunderstandings, and the user re-asks for clarity but does not express frustration or rejection of answers. The session is fully resolved with reliable content.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
