U35: No like for my teacher so I can ask her so can u write so I willcbe able to write ina. Good handwriting","### What to write neatly for your teacher

**Question:** \(2\frac{1}{5} \div 5\frac{3}{6}\)

1) Convert to improper fractions: 
\(2\frac{1}{5} = \frac{11}{5}\) 
\(5\frac{3}{6} = 5\frac{1}{2} = \frac{11}{2}\)

2) Change division to multiplication (reciprocal): 
\(\frac{11}{5} \div \frac{11}{2} = \frac{11}{5} \times \frac{2}{11}\)

3) Cancel \(11\): 
\(\frac{11}{5} \times \frac{2}{11} = \frac{1}{5} \times \frac{2}{1}\)

4) Multiply: 
\(\frac{1 \times 2}{5 \times 1} = \frac{2}{5}\)

