**Photosynthesis:** Photosynthesis is the process by which green plants make their own food. It happens mainly in the leaves because they have chlorophyll (green pigment). Plants use sunlight, water, and carbon dioxide to make glucose (food) and they release oxygen.

\[
\text{Carbon dioxide} + \text{Water} \xrightarrow{\text{Sunlight, Chlorophyll}} \text{Glucose} + \text{Oxygen}
\]
\[
6CO_2 + 6H_2O \rightarrow C_6H_{12}O_6 + 6O_2
\]

