U12: Divided and check --------following 6 )9832","**\(9832 \div 6\)**

- \(9 \div 6 = 1\) → \(1 \times 6 = 6\) → remainder \(9-6=3\); 8 नीचे उतारो → \(38\) 
- \(38 \div 6 = 6\) → \(6 \times 6 = 36\) → remainder \(38-36=2\); 3 नीचे उतारो → \(23\) 
- \(23 \div 6 = 3\) → \(3 \times 6 = 18\) → remainder \(23-18=5\); 2 नीचे उतारो → \(52\) 
- \(52 \div 6 = 8\) → \(8 \times 6 = 48\) → remainder \(52-48=4\)

तो भागफल \(1638\) और शेष \(4\)।

Check:
\[
6 \times 1638 + 4 = 9828 + 4 = 9832
\]

