तुम्हारा pehla sawaal tha: 
**“Rani Lakshmi Bai ka yuddh Lal Qila par lada gaya tha, us din tareekh (date) aur din kaun sa tha?”**

### सच्चाई क्या है?

- **Rani Lakshmi Bai ne Lal Qila (Delhi) par yuddh nahi lada.** 
- Unki sabse mashhoor ladaai **Jhansi** mein hui thi, 1857–1858 ke aas-paas. 
- Baad mein woh **Gwalior** ke paas ladiं. 
- Unki **veer-gati (mrityu)** ki tareekh itihaas mein **18 June 1858** likhi jaati hai. 
- Jagah ka naam tha **Kotah-ki-Serai (Gwalior ke paas)**, *na ki Lal Qila, Delhi*.

Isliye:

- **Lal Qila par Rani Lakshmi Bai ka yuddh hua hi nahi**, 
isliye uski **koi alag tareekh aur din** nahi milta.

Agar tum chaho to main tumhe 
