U3: is a physics question the value of acceleration due to gravity is 180 cm second square second square I mean what will be if the unit of length is km and the unit of time is minute no it's 98 okay the question is the value of acceleration due to gravity is 980 cm per second square what will be it if the unit of length is kilometre and the unit of time is minute
