U30: Explain 12 no","## Q12 (Triangles and Their Construction)

Given: In \(\triangle ABC\), \(DE \parallel BC\), \(\angle A = 75^\circ\), \(\angle B = 45^\circ\).

### (i) Find \(\angle ADE\)
Because \(DE \parallel BC\) and \(AD\) is a transversal, **corresponding angles are equal**:
\[
\angle ADE = \angle ABC = 45^\circ
\]

### (ii) Find \(\angle AED\)
In \(\triangle ADE\), angle sum is \(180^\circ\):
\[
\angle DAE + \angle ADE + \angle AED = 180^\circ
\]
Here \(\angle DAE = \angle A = 75^\circ\) and \(\angle ADE = 45^\circ\), so:
\[
75^\circ + 45^\circ + \angle AED = 180^\circ
\Rightarrow \angle AED = 60^\circ
\]

### (iii) Find \(\angle C\)
In \(\triangle ABC\), angle sum is \(180^\circ\):
\[
\angle A + \angle B + \angle C = 180^\circ
\]
\[
75^\circ + 45^\circ + \angle C = 180^\circ
\Rightarrow \angle C = 60^\circ
\]

### Final Answers
- (i) \(\angle ADE = 45^\circ\) 
- (ii) \(\angle AED = 60^\circ\) 
- (iii) \(\angle C = 60^\circ\)",Procedural,5,5,5,10,Academic | Specific Named Resource | Image Upload | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,23720,317,0.005650,"The bot consistently provided accurate, clear, and complete explanations aligned with the user's academic queries. It correctly handled image uploads and speech-to-text inputs without losing context or refusing to answer. There are no evident failures or user dissatisfaction in the conversation.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | same_intent_reask | paraphrase_reask | multiple_similar_requests | gate_llm,gate_llm
