- Losing track of time 
- Less sleep, more tiredness 
- Trouble focusing on studies 
- Feeling anxious without the phone 
- Skipping hobbies and family time 

## Why It Happens
- Endless videos = “just one more” 
- Likes/comments feel like rewards 
- The feed is made to keep you watching 

## Effects
- Poor concentration 
- Stress and low mood 
- Eye strain and headaches 
- Less real-life connection 

