81 = 9 \times 9
\]
\[
= (3 \times 3)\times(3 \times 3)
\]
\[
= 3 \times 3 \times 3 \times 3
\]

तो,
\[
\boxed{81 = 3 \times 3 \times 3 \times 3}
\]

