U36: Mujhe acche se question samajh nahin aaya wapas samjho","**156 cm को metre और millimetre में बदलना है।**

**(1) Metre में (cm → m)** 
- 1 metre \(=\) 100 cm 
- इसलिए cm से m में जाने के लिए **100 से भाग** देते हैं। 
\[
156 \text{ cm} \div 100 = 1.56 \text{ m}
\] 
**उत्तर: 156 cm = 1.56 m**

**(2) Millimetre में (cm → mm)** 
- 1 cm \(=\) 10 mm 
- इसलिए cm से mm में जाने के लिए **10 से गुणा** करते हैं। 
\[
156 \text{ cm} \times 10 = 1560 \text{ mm}
\] 
**उत्तर: 156 cm = 1560 mm**",Conceptual,1,1,2,2.6666666666666665,Academic | Specific Named Resource | Image Upload | Speech to Text | Slotfill,,Context Handling Failure | Image Gone Exception,0.9500,22183,405,0.005387,"The session is academic with multiple image uploads and speech-to-text inputs. The bot generally provides accurate and helpful explanations but fails to maintain context about the user's class and chapter, repeatedly asking for information already provided. Additionally, the bot fails to respond in one turn after an image upload, causing an image gone exception.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
