U31: Concept sahit","## कॉन्सेप्ट (समझ के साथ)

समांतर चतुर्भुज \(ABCD\) में **वेक्टर** के दो बहुत ज़रूरी नियम होते हैं:

### 1) विपरीत भुजाएँ बराबर और समान दिशा की होती हैं 
\[
\overrightarrow{AB}=\overrightarrow{DC},\quad \overrightarrow{AD}=\overrightarrow{BC}
\]

### 2) वेक्टर जोड़ (Triangle/Parallelogram law)
अगर \(A\) से \(C\) जाना है, तो \(A \to B\) और फिर \(B \to C\) जा सकते हैं:
\[
\overrightarrow{AC}=\overrightarrow{AB}+\overrightarrow{BC}
\]
और क्योंकि \(\overrightarrow{BC}=\overrightarrow{AD}\),
\[
\overrightarrow{AC}=\overrightarrow{AB}+\overrightarrow{AD}
\]

---

## अब \(\overrightarrow{BD}\) लिखते हैं
\(B\) से \(D\) जाने के लिए:
\[
\overrightarrow{BD}=\overrightarrow{BA}+\overrightarrow{AD}
\]
और \(\overrightarrow{BA}=-\overrightarrow{AB}\), इसलिए
\[
\overrightarrow{BD}=-\overrightarrow{AB}+\overrightarrow{AD}
\]

---

## अब घटाएँ: \(\overrightarrow{AC}-\overrightarrow{BD}\)

\[
\overrightarrow{AC}-\overrightarrow{BD}
=(\overrightarrow{AB}+\overrightarrow{AD})-(-\overrightarrow{AB}+\overrightarrow{AD})
\]

\[
=\overrightarrow{AB}+\overrightarrow{AD}+\overrightarrow{AB}-\overrightarrow{AD}
=2\overrightarrow{AB}
\]

---

## अंतिम उत्तर
\[
\boxed{\overrightarrow{AC}-\overrightarrow{BD}=2\overrightarrow{AB}}
\]

**सही विकल्प: (c) \(2\overline{AB}\)**",Procedural,5,5,5,10,Academic | Image Upload,,,0.9500,25119,245,0.005368,"The bot consistently provided accurate, clear, and complete explanations for all user queries, including step-by-step solutions and conceptual clarifications. There were no detected failures in context handling, correctness, or inappropriate template use. The session fully resolved the user's academic intents with high technical reliability and positive user sentiment.",0,full_rate,Academic,Concept Explanation,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
