## **C1. Hardware kya hota hai? Do examples do.**
**Hardware** computer ke **wo sab parts** hote hain jinhe hum **chhoo (touch) sakte hain**. 
**Examples:** **Keyboard**, **Mouse** (aur bhi: Monitor, CPU, Printer)

---

## **C2. Scanner kaise kaam karta hai?**
**Scanner** kagaz par bani **photo ya text** ko **computer mein digital form** (image/file) mein badal deta hai. 
- Paper ko scanner par rakhte hain 
- Scanner **light** se page ko read karta hai 
- Phir uski **copy** computer mein **image/document** ban jaati hai

---

## **C3. CPU ko computer ka “brain” kyon kehte hain?**
**CPU** computer ka **main part** hota hai jo:
- **data aur instructions ko process** karta hai 
- **calculations** karta hai 
- aur computer ke **baaki parts ko control** karta hai 

Isliye CPU ko computer ka **“brain”** kehte hain.

