### Very Simple Half–Half Back-Hand Design (Description)

**Layout:**
- Divide your back hand *diagonally* from the tip of the middle finger down towards the outer side of your wrist.
- The **upper-left half** (towards fingers) will have design.
- The **lower-right half** (towards wrist/inner side) will stay mostly plain.

**On the design half:**
- Starting at the middle finger: 
