U12: 3000 ka gunakkhand Kaise nikale","**3000 का गुणनखंड (factors) निकालने का तरीका और उत्तर (Hindi में):**

3000 को पहले आसान भागों में तोड़ते हैं:
\[
3000 = 3 \times 1000
\]
और
\[
1000 = 10^3 = (2 \times 5)^3 = 2^3 \times 5^3
\]
तो
\[
3000 = 3 \times 2^3 \times 5^3
\]

इसका मतलब:

- **अभाज्य गुणनखंड (Prime Factorization):** \(\mathbf{2^3 \times 3 \times 5^3}\) 
- यानी **\(3000 = 2 \times 2 \times 2 \times 3 \times 5 \times 5 \times 5\)**

अगर आप चाहें, मैं 3000 के **सभी factors (भाजक)** भी निकालना सिखा सकता/सकती हूँ—आपको “अभाज्य गुणनखंड” चाहिए था या “सभी factors”?",Small Talk,5,5,5,10,Academic | Not Math/Science | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,13815,265,0.003399,"The conversation is an academic session focused on English language learning with speech-to-text inputs. The bot provides accurate, relevant, and helpful responses without any failures or issues. The user sentiment is positive and no bot failures are detected.",0,full_rate,Academic,Other Academic,gate_llm,gate_llm
