U4: Does folic acid reduce liver enzymes","**Usually, no—folic acid isn’t known to reliably lower elevated liver enzymes (like ALT/AST), and it isn’t a standard treatment for high liver enzymes.** Enzymes typically go down when the underlying cause is treated (fatty liver, hepatitis, alcohol, certain medicines, etc.).

