U6: Satven ka a aur bi donon question solve karo","## प्रश्न 7 (समकोण त्रिभुज ABC में \( \angle B = 90^\circ\))

यहाँ **पाइथागोरस प्रमेय** लगेगा:

\[
AC^2 = AB^2 + BC^2
\]
(क्योंकि \(AC\) कर्ण है)

---

### (a) \(AB = 6\text{ cm},\; BC = 8\text{ cm}\) ⇒ \(AC\) ज्ञात कीजिए

\[
AC^2 = 6^2 + 8^2 = 36 + 64 = 100
\]
\[
AC = \sqrt{100} = 10\text{ cm}
\]

**उत्तर:** \(AC = 10\text{ cm}\)

---

### (b) \(AC = 13\text{ cm},\; BC = 5\text{ cm}\) ⇒ \(AB\) ज्ञात कीजिए

\[
AC^2 = AB^2 + BC^2
\Rightarrow AB^2 = AC^2 - BC^2
\]
\[
AB^2 = 13^2 - 5^2 = 169 - 25 = 144
\]
\[
AB = \sqrt{144} = 12\text{ cm}
\]

**उत्तर:** \(AB = 12\text{ cm}\)",Procedural,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Image Upload | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,14318,277,0.003536,"The bot correctly understood and addressed the user's academic math queries, including image-based problems and speech-to-text inputs, without any failures. There are no evidence of bot errors, context issues, or unwanted template pushes. User sentiment is neutral with no explicit frustration or complaint.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | multiple_similar_requests | gate_llm,gate_llm
