**Step 3: Find the middle position:** 
When there are 15 numbers, the middle one is the 8th number (because 7 will be on the left and 7 on the right).

**Step 4: Look at the 8th number in the ordered list:** 

1st: 5 
2nd: 9 
3rd: 10 
4th: 12 
5th: 15 
6th: 16 
7th: 19 
**8th: 20** ← middle one 
9th: 20 
10th: 20 
11th: 20 
12th: 23 
13th: 24 
14th: 25 
15th: 25 

