A handwritten Hindi mathematics exercise asking for the derivatives of several natural logarithmic expressions, including ln(4x), ln(2x), ln(x²), ln(x³), ln(2x²), ln(7x⁵), ln(x), and ln(x)/x. The page also shows an attempted solution using the chain rule and the rule d(ln x)/dx = 1/x.
U5: isko solve Karke batao mujhe samajh mein nahin a raha hai mujhe samajh mein nahin a Raha Maine Tumko Jitna question Bheja Hai Na vah Sara Ka Sawal batao acche se","**दिए गए सभी फलनों का \(x\) के सापेक्ष अवकलज (derivative) चाहिए। मुख्य नियम:** 
\[
\frac{d}{dx}\big(\ln u\big)=\frac{u'}{u}, \qquad \frac{d}{dx}(\ln x)=\frac1x
\]
(मैं बीच में सरल steps दिखाऊँगा/दिखाऊँगी।)

---

**(i) \(\ln(4x)\)** 
यहाँ \(u=4x \Rightarrow u'=4\)
\[
\frac{d}{dx}\ln(4x)=\frac{4}{4x}=\frac1x
\]

**(ii) \(\ln(2x)\)** 
\(u=2x,\;u'=2\)
\[
\frac{d}{dx}\ln(2x)=\frac{2}{2x}=\frac1x
\]

**(iii) \(\ln(x^2)\)** 
\(u=x^2,\;u'=2x\)
\[
\frac{d}{dx}\ln(x^2)=\frac{2x}{x^2}=\frac{2}{x}
\]
(ध्यान: \(\ln(x^2)=2\ln|x|\) भी लिख सकते हैं, derivative वही \(\frac{2}{x}\) आता है जहाँ परिभाषित हो।)

**(iv) \(\ln(x^3)\)** 
\(u=x^3,\;u'=3x^2\)
\[
\frac{d}{dx}\ln(x^3)=\frac{3x^2}{x^3}=\frac{3}{x}
\]

**(v) \(\ln(2x^2)\)** 
\(u=2x^2,\;u'=4x\)
\[
\frac{d}{dx}\ln(2x^2)=\frac{4x}{2x^2}=\frac{2}{x}
\]

**(vi) \(\ln(7x^5)\)** 
\(u=7x^5,\;u'=35x^4\)
\[
\frac{d}{dx}\ln(7x^5)=\frac{35x^4}{7x^5}=\frac{5}{x}
\]

**(vii) \(\ln x\)** 
\[
\frac{d}{dx}(\ln x)=\frac1x
\]

**(viii) \(\dfrac{\ln x}{x}\)** 
इसे \( (\ln x)\,x^{-1}\) मानकर product rule करें:
\[
\frac{d}{dx}\left(\frac{\ln x}{x}\right)
= \left(\frac1x\right)\cdot x^{-1}+(\ln x)\cdot(-1)x^{-2}
= \frac{1}{x^2}-\frac{\ln x}{x^2}
= \frac{1-\ln x}{x^2}
\]

---

**अंतिम उत्तर (सभी):** 
\[
\begin{aligned}
\text{(i)}\;&\frac1x \quad
\text{(ii)}\;&\frac1x \quad
\text{(iii)}\;&\frac{2}{x} \quad
\text{(iv)}\;&\frac{3}{x} \\
\text{(v)}\;&\frac{2}{x} \quad
\text{(vi)}\;&\frac{5}{x} \quad
\text{(vii)}\;&\frac1x \quad
\text{(viii)}\;&\frac{1-\ln x}{x^2}
\end{aligned}
\]

अगर चाहें तो बताइए आपको (viii) में **product rule** ज्यादा confusing लग रहा है या \(\ln u\) वाले **chain rule** में दिक्कत है—मैं उसी हिस्से को और धीरे-धीरे समझा दूँगा/दूँगी।",Small Talk,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Image Upload | Speech to Text | Blurry / Unclear Image,,,0.9500,14107,304,0.003534,"The bot correctly identified the problem and provided a detailed, step-by-step solution to the user's derivative questions. It appropriately handled unclear images by requesting clearer input and did not exhibit any failures or misunderstandings. The user re-asked for clarification but did not indicate dissatisfaction or frustration.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | multiple_similar_requests | gate_llm,gate_llm
