U4: Chapter no; 5","**Chapter 5 ka naam/state book kaunsa hai?** (NCERT Science ya koi aur?) 
NCERT Class 6 Science me Chapter 5 **“Separation of Substances” (पदार्थों का पृथक्करण)** hota hai—agar yehi hai, to main is chapter ke questions de rahi/raha hoon:

1) **Handpicking** method kis type ke mixture ko separate karne me use hota hai? Ek example do. 
2) **Threshing** aur **winnowing** me difference kya hai? 
3) Chawal (rice) me se chhote patthar alag karne ke liye kaunsa method best hoga—**sieving, handpicking, filtration**? Kyun? 
