U6: find out the difference using expand form: 44,390 from 67805","Start with \(67{,}805 - 44{,}390\).

Expanded form:
\[
67{,}805 = 60{,}000 + 7{,}000 + 800 + 0 + 5
\]
\[
44{,}390 = 40{,}000 + 4{,}000 + 300 + 90 + 0
\]

Subtract place by place:
\[
(60{,}000-40{,}000)=20{,}000
\]
\[
(7{,}000-4{,}000)=3{,}000
\]
\[
(800-300)=500
\]
For tens, you can’t do \(0-90\), so take \(100\) from the \(500\):
\[
500 = 400 + 100
\]
Now:
\[
100-90=10
\]
\[
5-0=5
\]

Add what’s left:
\[
20{,}000 + 3{,}000 + 400 + 10 + 5 = 23{,}415
\]

**Difference = \(\mathbf{23{,}415}\)**",Procedural,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,12850,225,0.003180,The bot correctly answered all math questions and appropriately requested clarification when user input was unclear. There are no detected failures or issues in the conversation. User sentiment is neutral with no explicit frustration or praise.,0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,gate_llm | last_bot_refusal_stall,gate_llm
