- Batteries

### 2) **Recovered Materials**
- **Copper** (wires, coils)
- **Aluminium** (frames, casings)
- **Iron/Steel** (parts, tools)
- **Gold/Silver (tiny amounts)** (connectors)
- **Plastic** (covers, keys)
- **Glass** (screens)

