U6: Letter had written by reena . Kya ye sahi hai","नहीं, यह सही नहीं है।

### सही वाक्य (Passive)
**The letter was written by Reena.**

### क्यों?
- **“had written”** (Past Perfect) अकेले passive में ऐसे नहीं आता। 
- यहाँ **Simple Past passive** चाहिए: **was/were + past participle (V3)**

### Structure
**Object + was/were + V3 + by + Subject** 
**letter + was + written + by + Reena**",Unit Conversion,4,4,3,7.333333333333333,Academic | Not Math/Science | Mock / Practice Questions | Speech to Text | Slotfill,,,0.9500,12994,416,0.003340,"The bot correctly answered the user's queries about active and passive voice and provided practice questions as requested. However, the use of a Type: TEST_PREP slotfill for a Hindi grammar topic is out-of-scope, triggering an Unwanted Template Push issue. Overall, the session is helpful but slightly downgraded due to this inappropriate template usage.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,gate_llm,gate_llm
4c06a00a-1d45-4ff9-89fd-b1a9a6466f78,2026-08-16T07:34:12.971Z,1,5,"U1: Find the HCF by division method question 405 786 513
U2: V ध्वनि herbs डीएम हम ए ujjक में टीम
U3: find the greatest which divide 270 and 84 leaving a remainder 2 in each are
U4: फाइंड द ग्रेटेस्ट नंबर विच डिवाइड 97 और 80 एवं रिमाइंडर3,5और 7
U5: फाइंड द ग्रेटेस्ट नंबर था वे डिवाइड 373 ,330 और 82 गिविंग हिम एंड 3,5 और 7 रिप्रेजेंट","**ऐसी कोई संख्या (greatest number) संभव नहीं है।**

अगर कोई संख्या \(d\) 373, 330 और 82 को भाग दे और क्रमशः शेष \(3,5,7\) आए, तो:

\[
d \mid (373-3)=370
\]
\[
d \mid (330-5)=325
\]
\[
d \mid (82-7)=75
\]

तो \(d\) को 370, 325 और 75 तीनों को पूरा-पूरा भाग देना होगा, यानी
\[
d=\gcd(370,325,75)
\]

अब:
\[
\gcd(370,325)=5 \quad (\text{क्योंकि } 370-325=45,\ \gcd(325,45)=5)
\]
\[
\gcd(5,75)=5
\]
इसलिए \(\gcd(370,325,75)=5\).

लेकिन शेष \(7\) आने के लिए divisor \(d\) **7 से बड़ा** होना चाहिए (क्योंकि शेष हमेशा divisor से छोटा होता है)। 
यहाँ \(d=5\) आता है, जो \(7\) से छोटा है, इसलिए शेष \(7\) आ ही नहीं सकता।

**Final: \(\mathbf{\text{ऐसी कोई संख्या नहीं है।}}\)**",Procedural,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,13406,245,0.003311,The bot correctly answered all math questions and handled the speech-to-text input appropriately without any failures. There are no detected bot failures or session pattern issues. The user rephrased questions but did not indicate dissatisfaction or correction ignored.,0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,multiple_similar_requests | gate_llm,gate_llm
