Suppose it’s **10:50 p.m.** and you add **2 h 50 min**.

Convert to minutes:
\[
10{:}50 = 10\times 60 + 50 = 650 \text{ min}
\]
\[
2\text{ h }50\text{ min} = 2\times 60 + 50 = 170 \text{ min}
\]

Add:
\[
650 + 170 = 820 \text{ min}
\]

Convert back:
\[
820 \div 60 = 13 \text{ remainder } 40
\]
