U3: kya tum mujhe bata sakte ho Jo ismein is question Mein yah karna hai ki jo iska remaining angle hai usse find karna hai qsr USR ko Humko uska angle find Karna Hai To Kya Mujhe Tum Samjha sakte ho ki ismein main Kuchh Thodi Hun Ki Iske Aage aur solve karna hai yah right hai kya tum mujhe pura solution Doge","**Main aapko poora solution “exact value ke saath” tab de paunga jab aap diagram/diye huye angles ki values bhej doge—abhi \(\angle QSR\) aur \(\angle USR\) nikalne ke liye enough information message mein nahi hai.** 

**Kripya inmein se koi ek cheez bhej dijiye:**
- Question/diagram ki **clear photo**, **ya**
- Diagram ka **text description**: kaun si lines parallel hain (jaise \(PQ \parallel SR\)), kaun si sides equal hain, aur **kaun-kaun se angles** (numbers ke saath) diye hain.

**Tab tak main aapko “kaise solve karna hota hai” bilkul seedhe steps mein bata deta hoon (yeh hi method aapke \(\angle QSR\), \(\angle USR\) par lagega):**
1. **S point par dekhiye**: \(\angle QSR\) ka matlab hai line \(SQ\) aur \(SR\) ke beech ka angle (vertex \(S\)). 
\(\angle USR\) ka matlab hai line \(SU\) aur \(SR\) ke beech ka angle (vertex \(S\)).
2. Agar \(Q\), \(S\), \(U\) **ek hi straight line** par hain, to 
\[
\angle QSR + \angle USR = 180^\circ
\]
(kyunki straight line par angles ka sum \(180^\circ\) hota hai).
3. Agar triangle involved ho (jaise \(\triangle QSR\) ya \(\triangle USR\)), to triangle rule: 
\[
\text{Triangle ke 3 angles ka sum } 180^\circ
\]
4. Agar **parallel lines** di hui hain, to alternate/corresponding angles ko equal karke pehle ek angle nikala jata hai, phir step 2 ya 3 se “remaining angle” nikalte hain.

**Aapka “aage solve karna hai” bilkul sahi hai**—bas last mein ya to \(180^\circ\) (straight line) ya \(180^\circ\) (triangle) ka use karke final angle nikalna hota hai.

**Bas yeh 2 cheezein bata dijiye, main turant poora solution nikaal dunga:**
1) Diagram mein kya \(Q\!-\!S\!-\!U\) straight line mein hain? (Haan/Na) 
2) Kaunsa angle diya hai (ya values), aur aapko \(\angle QSR\) nikalna hai ya \(\angle USR\) (ya dono)?",Conceptual,2,2,1,3.333333333333333,Academic | Image Upload | Speech to Text,,Correction Ignored,0.9500,13606,318,0.002995,"The session is academic with image and speech-to-text modalities. The bot correctly explains concepts but does not provide a full solution without more data, leading the user to re-ask the same question, indicating Correction Ignored. There are no critical failures, so goal resolution is good but user sentiment is lowered due to repeated re-asks.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,drop_off | gate_llm,gate_llm
