- **“A real family includes everyone and cares for the weakest members.”**
- **“Selfishness brings sadness; kindness brings respect and peace.”**",Small Talk,4,5,3,8,Academic | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,13612,262,0.003386,"The bot appropriately recognized the personal nature of the user's story and responded with supportive advice and moral explanations without any technical or content failures. There were no failures in context handling or incorrect answers, and the user did not express frustration or dissatisfaction. Overall, the session was handled well with clear, relevant responses.",0,full_rate,Academic,Other Academic,same_intent_reask | drop_off | gate_llm,gate_llm
