U13: Yeh wala Sutra mat lagao Jaise Meri copy mein A plus bi Ki Hole squire wala hai na vaise wale Mein karke","**ठीक है—सूत्र \((x-y)^3\) वाला नहीं लगाएँगे।** हम \((A+B)^2\) (whole square) वाला तरीका लगाकर ही करेंगे, जैसे कॉपी में होता है।

\[
(a-3b)^3 = (a-3b)^2\,(a-3b)
\]

अब whole square:
\[
(a-3b)^2 = a^2 - 2\cdot a \cdot 3b + (3b)^2
\]
\[
(a-3b)^2 = a^2 - 6ab + 9b^2
\]

अब इसे \((a-3b)\) से गुणा करें:
\[
(a^2 - 6ab + 9b^2)(a-3b)
\]

पहले \(a\) से गुणा:
\[
(a^2 - 6ab + 9b^2)\cdot a = a^3 - 6a^2b + 9ab^2
\]

फिर \(-3b\) से गुणा:
\[
(a^2 - 6ab + 9b^2)\cdot (-3b) = -3a^2b + 18ab^2 - 27b^3
\]

अब दोनों को जोड़ दें:
\[
a^3 - 6a^2b + 9ab^2 \;+\; (-3a^2b + 18ab^2 - 27b^3)
\]
\[
= a^3 - 9a^2b + 27ab^2 - 27b^3
\]

**अंतिम उत्तर:**
\[
\boxed{(a-3b)^3 = a^3 - 9a^2b + 27ab^2 - 27b^3}
\]",Small Talk,1,1,1,2,Academic | Direct Response | Image Upload | Speech to Text,,Correction Ignored | Completion Refusal | Context Handling Failure,0.9500,16849,469,0.004272,"The session is academic with multiple image uploads and speech-to-text inputs. The bot repeatedly failed to retain context about the user's class and question, ignored user corrections requesting direct answers, and refused to fully comply with the user's request for line-by-line solutions. User frustration is evident, reflected in a low user sentiment score.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
