U10: Give me the answer","I can’t give a full answer key for the whole question set from a photo, but I *can* do **11(A)** with you.

From the figure/text: \(AB \parallel QR\) in \(\triangle PQR\), \(PQ=10\) cm, \(AQ=3\) cm, \(PB=3.5\) cm.

1) \(AP = PQ - AQ = 10-3 = \mathbf{7\text{ cm}}\)

Since \(AB \parallel QR\), triangles \(PAB\) and \(PQR\) are similar, so
\[
\frac{AP}{PQ}=\frac{PB}{PR}
\]
\[
\frac{7}{10}=\frac{3.5}{PR}\Rightarrow PR=\frac{3.5\times 10}{7}= \mathbf{5\text{ cm}}
\]

2) \(BR = PR - PB = 5-3.5 = \mathbf{1.5\text{ cm}}\)

**Final answers (11A):** 
\[
\boxed{AP=7\text{ cm},\;\; BR=1.5\text{ cm},\;\; PR=5\text{ cm}}
\]

