f87ce5e3-d1f9-4284-aa73-9d51b08a13b0,2026-08-16T04:03:38.374Z,31116039,6,"U1: Three rational numbers x, y, z satisfy x + y + z =0 and xy + yz + zx =0 Show that all the rational numbers x, y, z must be simultaneously zero
U2: What are the potential health risks associated with vaping
