U5: My teacher have given very long answer to learn and said to write the exact answers how should I learn them","### If your teacher wants **exact long answers**, learn them like a script (but in parts)

## 1) Don’t memorize the whole answer at once
Break every long answer into **small blocks**:
- **Intro (1–2 lines)**
- **Point 1–5** (each point = heading + 2–3 lines)
